Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.22,0:00:26.68,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Watch out, Tomoya-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.56,0:00:31.68,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Tomoya-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.68,0:00:34.81,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah. I spaced out there for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.15,0:00:36.77,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Don't be looking up at the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.15,0:00:36.77,Default-alt,Kid,0,0,0,,We're sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.77,0:00:38.19,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,It's not my fault if you get hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.19,0:00:40.40,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Dad's at bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.40,0:00:43.19,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I want you to cheer for him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.19,0:00:45.70,Default,San,0,0,0,,Akio-san, fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.70,0:00:47.41,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,This home run is...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.78,0:00:48.66,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Sanae!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.99,0:00:51.62,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,This one's for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.08,0:00:53.20,Default,San,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.20,0:00:54.58,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You're amazing, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.17,0:00:58.08,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You see that?!
