Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.72,0:02:35.10,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Hey. We're gonna go play baseball.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.35,0:02:36.93,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.93,0:02:38.39,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Don't give me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.39,0:02:40.44,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,There's another game next Sunday,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.44,0:02:43.15,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,so I'm telling you to go get a team together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.15,0:02:44.15,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You never did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.65,0:02:47.61,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,We're up against the neighboring shopping district team.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.61,0:02:51.45,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,They're the rival of our shopping district team.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.78,0:02:54.66,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Dad's part of the adult team, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.87,0:02:58.66,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,But they've recently recruited a former Koshien player.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.87,0:02:58.66,Note,Aki,0,0,0,,Note: Koshien is the Japanese national highschool baseball tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.20,0:03:02.12,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Thanks to that, we're on a losing streak against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.12,0:03:03.67,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,We're pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.67,0:03:07.88,Default,San,0,0,0,,So that's why the neighbors do not look as cheerful as they normally are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.13,0:03:12.76,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,To liven up our town, we've got to win the next match no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.09,0:03:15.01,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I don't care if the entire team's made up of helpers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.01,0:03:17.51,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,What's most important is to reverse this course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.51,0:03:19.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So why do I have to be a part of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.06,0:03:21.10,Default-alt,San,0,0,0,,Nagisa, could you pass me the soy sauce?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.14,0:03:21.10,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Second semester starts for you guys today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.10,0:03:24.73,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You've got your buddies in the school theater club.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.69,0:03:22.60,Default-alt,Nag,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.23,0:03:29.19,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,From the moment I saw the teamwork\Nyou guys showed at the School Festival,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.19,0:03:31.99,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I've been wanting to play baseball with you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.45,0:03:36.07,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,If you're Nagisa's boyfriend,\Nthen be nice to the daddy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.07,0:03:39.33,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey! You know my right shoulder's injured!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.49,0:03:42.96,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You lit the fire in my heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.96,0:03:45.25,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Like the fireball!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.25,0:03:47.13,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That made no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.42,0:03:51.13,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,We might be able to make a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.47,0:03:55.14,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\pos(960,410.000015)\3c&H4A8A5C&}Episode 1
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.47,0:03:55.14,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\3c&H4A8A5C&\pos(960,720)}A Farewell to the End of Summer
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.76,0:03:57.35,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The second semester has started.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.10,0:04:01.39,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm still living at Nagisa's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.98,0:04:06.40,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,As a senior in high school, we should be starting to decide our futures.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.90,0:04:10.65,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But I still don't have a clue about my future.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.15,0:04:11.90,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I'm in!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.40,0:04:13.82,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,It sounds fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.03,0:04:17.20,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Having Kyou-chan on the team will make us invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.20,0:04:22.58,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,To draft this Sunohara Youhei...\NNagisa-chan's father knows how to pick 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.58,0:04:27.13,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah. He has high hopes for\Nyour prodigy-like athleticism.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.13,0:04:32.21,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I see. So talent seems to pour out\Neven when you're trying to hide it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.21,0:04:34.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He's as easy to manipulate as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.97,0:04:35.97,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,What did you just say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.97,0:04:37.05,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I was just joking with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.05,0:04:41.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You're a super prodigy and super athletic,\Nand super-slim so super-safe at night, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.05,0:04:41.97,Note,Oka,0,0,0,,Note: Okazaki is making a reference to the commercial tag line for menstrual pads
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.27,0:04:43.18,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Damn right I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.43,0:04:46.69,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun. I want to try playing baseball, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.69,0:04:48.94,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Do you know the rules, Kotomi?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.94,0:04:53.61,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I watched you and Tomoyo-chan having a match against the Baseball Team.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.61,0:04:55.70,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,It looked like lots of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.70,0:04:56.70,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You were watching that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.70,0:04:58.95,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,What about you, Ryou?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.95,0:05:02.70,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I-I'll cheer from the side.\NI don't have confidence in sports.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.04,0:05:05.50,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'll do my best at cheering, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.50,0:05:07.79,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Good luck, Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.00,0:05:09.96,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.96,0:05:13.46,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You guys are looking more and more like a couple now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.13,0:05:16.63,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.30,0:05:19.97,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,What do you want, calling me to a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.14,0:05:22.85,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sunohara wants to do something perverted to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.56,0:05:29.56,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I guess there wasn't a need to test Tomoyo's athleticism.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.56,0:05:31.32,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Am I a measurement tool?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.32,0:05:32.57,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,What is this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.07,0:05:36.57,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's amazing that even Tomoyo-san's joining.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.57,0:05:38.95,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,I haven't decided to, yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.95,0:05:42.03,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,I said I would if Misae-san would, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.03,0:05:46.33,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Misae-san looks like she has good athleticism, so we've got to talk her into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.33,0:05:49.08,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I've known her for a long time, so it'll work if I ask her to join.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.21,0:05:53.09,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's Yoshino Yusuke-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.25,0:05:55.96,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Ah, from the wedding some time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.96,0:05:58.68,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Perfect. Let's invite him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.68,0:06:01.43,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Hey, Yoshino-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.93,0:06:04.06,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It looks like he didn't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.06,0:06:05.93,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Let's start a Yoshino call.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.93,0:06:07.23,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yoshino call?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.23,0:06:09.27,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Like calling for an encore at concerts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.60,0:06:13.94,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Then I bet he'll remember the days he was a musician and answer us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.94,0:06:15.07,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.07,0:06:29.66,Default,All,0,0,0,,YOSHINO! YOSHINO! YOSHINO!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.57,0:06:20.20,Default-alt,Sun,0,0,0,,Louder!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.87,0:06:32.00,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,What kind of harassment is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.54,0:06:35.09,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,I can't. I have work on Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.09,0:06:37.13,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.13,0:06:39.30,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,It's nothing personal. See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.30,0:06:40.13,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.55,0:06:43.64,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun. I don't think you should push it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.05,0:06:48.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He... Sunohara looks up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.81,0:06:53.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,His house is up north, so when he graduates,\Nhe probably won't ever come back to this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.73,0:07:00.61,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So he wants to create a memory with the man\Nhe looks up to, you, Yoshino-san, before he departs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.95,0:07:02.99,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Who knew he felt such a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.99,0:07:04.62,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.62,0:07:06.99,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Okazaki... You were that considerate of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.99,0:07:08.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You guys shouldn't cry over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.00,0:07:09.87,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.58,0:07:12.62,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Sorry for being so thoughtless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.62,0:07:14.21,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.21,0:07:16.80,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'll try to make some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.30,0:07:19.01,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,What do you all want with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.46,0:07:20.76,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Let's play baseball!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.76,0:07:21.68,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.68,0:07:22.43,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.55,0:07:26.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It looks like it's better for you to stay quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.10,0:07:27.35,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.35,0:07:30.39,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Misae-san, could you hear us out?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.06,0:07:32.27,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,You still need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.27,0:07:33.60,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Let's play base-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.31,0:07:35.90,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,You keep your mouth shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.11,0:07:38.02,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Oh, Sakagami-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.02,0:07:39.65,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Are you here to ask questions about the student council again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.86,0:07:41.40,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Not today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.78,0:07:44.41,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,We wish to play baseball with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.41,0:07:45.66,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Baseball?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.66,0:07:49.79,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Yes. You're... my goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.79,0:07:52.41,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,And I want to be your rival, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.66,0:07:57.42,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,If we can fight through sports, I'm sure there is much that I can learn from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.00,0:07:59.92,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Could you come play with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:04.47,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I can't say no when I see those eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.89,0:08:09.26,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,We managed to get nine people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.26,0:08:11.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Didn't think the last person would be Mei-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.52,0:08:13.19,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I wonder if she'll really come.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.64,0:08:18.15,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Let's have your father come, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.57,0:08:21.65,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Let's have him see you working hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.19,0:08:26.16,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I want to properly meet your father, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.57,0:08:29.87,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Maybe next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.37,0:08:30.91,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.25,0:08:34.37,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.37,0:08:35.75,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.72,0:08:52.77,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I-I-I-It really is Yoshino Yusuke-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.02,0:08:55.48,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm glad you were able to get here in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.48,0:08:59.02,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,When I told her she could meet Yoshino Yusuke, she came flying over on an overnight bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.02,0:09:02.15,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,I remember you well, Sagara-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.15,0:09:04.28,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,You always stood out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.32,0:09:07.53,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Thank you for your guidance during those days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.07,0:09:10.20,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Looks like you're getting along well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.20,0:09:11.79,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Thanks for your concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.16,0:09:15.46,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Misae-san and Yoshino-san all knew each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.46,0:09:16.50,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.50,0:09:18.12,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Bring it in, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.17,0:09:21.29,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Thank you all for coming today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.29,0:09:22.84,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,It's my honor to have you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.88,0:09:26.13,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,But it's pointless if we lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.72,0:09:29.64,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Anyone who screws up will have to eat Sanae's bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.10,0:09:31.76,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Play like you mean it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.76,0:09:33.85,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,What does he mean by Sanae's bread?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.85,0:09:35.68,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's better that you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.52,0:09:38.48,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,The game's starting!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.48,0:09:40.06,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Do your best, Onee-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.06,0:09:41.44,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Good luck, Yu-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.44,0:09:43.73,Default,San,0,0,0,,Everyone, fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.82,0:09:43.73,Default-alt,Bot,0,0,0,,Puhi puhi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.86,0:09:48.36,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,To challenge us with a slapped-together team like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.53,0:09:50.70,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,You've lost your wits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.62,0:09:53.24,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I'm not sure about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.45,0:09:57.29,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,This might turn out to be the most entertaining team.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.67,0:10:01.88,Default,Ump,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.84,0:10:03.88,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,It's fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.88,0:10:07.84,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Your brother's the only person who can catch a pitch like that amongst us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.59,0:10:10.18,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,My hand's gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.34,0:10:13.68,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,No one cares about your hand, so make sure you catch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.93,0:10:16.35,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Aren't you too harsh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.35,0:10:17.89,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Three up and three down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.14,0:10:19.64,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,It's a nice start.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.64,0:10:22.02,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey, was he a lefty hitter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.02,0:10:27.07,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I bet he's thinking the left batter's box\Nis closer to first base.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.57,0:10:34.66,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Faked a swing and bunted instead...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.66,0:10:37.08,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,And a pop up, too. So lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.08,0:10:38.79,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,That's a horrible start for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.79,0:10:40.33,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,You're a pox on the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.33,0:10:42.38,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,We're up against a Koshien-level pitcher!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.38,0:10:43.84,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Can you hit it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.29,0:10:46.09,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Let me show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.30,0:10:52.80,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.22,0:10:54.14,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.14,0:10:56.14,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Let me hit third!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.14,0:10:58.06,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Do you not know the rules?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.56,0:11:02.40,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Let's get three runs, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.81,0:11:02.40,Default-alt,San,0,0,0,,Akio-san, fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.98,0:11:06.61,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Hey! Why don't you face me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.61,0:11:08.28,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We have one out and the bases loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.28,0:11:09.78,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We're counting on you, Tomoyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.78,0:11:13.07,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,It's my first time being the batter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.07,0:11:14.45,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Switch the grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.87,0:11:15.66,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Is this right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.66,0:11:18.50,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Widen your stance and lower your center of mass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.83,0:11:21.00,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,When you hit, you run to first base.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.46,0:11:23.63,Default,Ump,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.63,0:11:24.46,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Tomoyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.46,0:11:26.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't swing at anything that's not in this zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.46,0:11:26.67,Default-alt,Mei,0,0,0,,Tomoyo-san! Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.55,0:11:38.56,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Take that, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.56,0:11:39.47,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,That's impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.31,0:11:42.81,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Sorry. I made us lose the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.81,0:11:45.56,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's fine! Go take your lap!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.23,0:11:48.86,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,0)\fs60\blur1\b1\frx22\fax-0.2\fry326\fnEraserDust\frz21.132\c&HD9E3B1&\pos(526.5,354)}Team
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.23,0:11:48.86,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,0)\frx22\fry326\fnEraserDust\fax-0.2\b1\fs50\frz21.132\c&HD9E3B1&\pos(639,268.5)\blur1}Innings
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.23,0:11:48.86,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,0)\fnEraserDust\b1\blur1\c&HD9E3B1&\fs32\frz24.15\frx-10\fax-0.7\pos(622,518.5)}Smells like teen spirit
Dialogue: 1,0:11:47.23,0:11:48.86,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fnEraserDust\b1\blur1\c&HD9E3B1&\fs42\frz22.7\pos(567,778.5)\fax-0.67}Furukawa Bakers
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.07,0:11:51.11,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,He looks really strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.11,0:11:53.61,Default,Oak,0,0,0,,Yeah. Can't expect less from a former Koshien player.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.00,0:12:10.92,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.92,0:12:11.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.80,0:12:13.84,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.84,0:12:15.51,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You did that on purpose, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.51,0:12:17.72,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,N-No, it was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.22,0:12:21.52,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,What do you want to do now?\NDo you want to borrow a player from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.52,0:12:24.35,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Don't be a fool! That'd make this game pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.52,0:12:28.15,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,For the sake of this town, we can't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.86,0:12:31.23,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Pitcher change.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.69,0:12:33.32,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Relief pitcher!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.36,0:12:35.66,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Furukawa Nagisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.08,0:12:44.37,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Will Nagisa-chan be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.54,0:12:49.67,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,When a person with good athleticism pitches, they're more prone to getting hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.67,0:12:54.84,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,On the other hand, a slow, arcing ball\Nthrown by a bad pitcher is harder to hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.84,0:12:57.59,Default,San,0,0,0,,Nagisa! Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.59,0:12:58.55,Default,Bot,0,0,0,,Puhi puhi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.10,0:13:01.31,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa, take it easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.31,0:13:03.68,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Even if you get hit, we're here to cover you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.68,0:13:06.31,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.10,0:13:09.73,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Come on, Nagisa-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.65,0:13:17.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Tomoyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.57,0:13:20.07,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.28,0:13:23.45,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I managed to hold on for the inning thanks to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.45,0:13:25.21,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,It's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.21,0:13:27.75,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,That's what we're there for.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.75,0:13:28.63,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Okazaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.08,0:13:31.29,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Make sure to get on base before me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.29,0:13:34.09,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't ask for the impossible from a person with a bad shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.09,0:13:37.55,Default,Ump,0,0,0,,Strike! Batter out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.05,0:13:44.77,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Probability of the first ball being on a low-inside trajectory: 62%.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.77,0:13:46.64,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Length of the bat: 800mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.64,0:13:48.52,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Diameter of the ball: 70mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.52,0:13:54.23,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Incorporate my arm length, range of motion,\Nand the speed of the ball into the calculation,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.23,0:13:55.94,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,then I'm sure I can hit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.61,0:14:01.20,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Woah. An accidental hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.20,0:14:02.53,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Kotomi, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.12,0:14:05.25,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.25,0:14:07.71,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.71,0:14:09.21,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'm up next.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.21,0:14:10.79,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Time to go get my name tarnished.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.79,0:14:12.21,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's a horrible time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.92,0:14:18.55,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.72,0:14:19.97,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Are you an idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.97,0:14:22.60,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Kotomi was on the base and you totally wasted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.60,0:14:24.31,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,You suck, Sunohara.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.31,0:14:26.02,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,So lame...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.02,0:14:28.27,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Indeed the time to tarnish your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.19,0:14:31.06,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,No outs, runner at third.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.44,0:14:33.52,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Another moment of truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.52,0:14:35.32,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,You can do it, Nagisa-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.90,0:14:38.70,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's going to right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.91,0:14:47.29,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I caught it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.29,0:14:48.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Kotomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.33,0:14:49.87,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Throw it back home!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.87,0:14:51.37,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Hurry! Throw it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.88,0:14:53.38,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.38,0:14:55.80,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I forgot about the tag up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.80,0:14:59.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't worry. You limited us to giving up only one run.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.01,0:15:00.34,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You did fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.34,0:15:02.43,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,We just have to get it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.43,0:15:03.76,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Swing away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.72,0:15:08.85,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Our girls are amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.27,0:15:12.35,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,They're getting one hit after another off a former Koshien pitcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.52,0:15:14.40,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,It's no outs with runners on first and third!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.40,0:15:15.48,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Who's up next?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.19,0:15:19.69,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.86,0:15:21.40,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,A squeeze will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.40,0:15:23.32,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,S-quiz?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.32,0:15:25.20,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,What kind of quiz is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.20,0:15:27.58,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Don't worry and swing with all your might!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.91,0:15:29.66,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Strike! Batter out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.08,0:15:31.16,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.37,0:15:34.42,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Who cares? It's our slugger, Tomo-pyon, next.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.42,0:15:36.92,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Don't give me a strange nickname.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.92,0:15:40.42,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Tomoyo-san, hit another home run for us please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.42,0:15:42.22,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.22,0:15:43.34,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.72,0:15:48.18,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,I want to hit a small clean hit like a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.39,0:15:50.22,Default,San,0,0,0,,Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.36,0:15:58.44,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,It's hard to hit a girl-like hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.94,0:16:02.07,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Okazaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.07,0:16:04.78,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The best I can do with this shoulder is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.07,0:16:04.16,Default-alt,Mei,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.66,0:16:10.20,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.54,0:16:13.21,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Not my kind of play.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.75,0:16:16.38,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,But not a bad tactic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.59,0:16:18.67,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Okazaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.17,0:16:21.42,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You've fallen to the pits.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.42,0:16:24.47,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's better than ending up in a double play like someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.47,0:16:25.89,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.89,0:16:28.35,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,If you're a man, you've got to challenge things!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.31,0:16:35.44,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Nice one, Misae-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.44,0:16:36.65,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Don't call me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.78,0:16:42.99,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,That's the way I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.82,0:16:47.24,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Yoshino-san, good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.24,0:16:48.20,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.87,0:16:50.16,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.91,0:16:54.16,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,I couldn't contribute to any plays so far,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.16,0:16:57.71,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,but for the sake of the kids here, I will hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.71,0:16:59.17,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.34,0:17:01.46,Default,San,0,0,0,,Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.34,0:17:03.13,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Here's my {\alpha&HFF}gift to all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.59,0:17:04.38,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Here's my gift {\alpha&HFF}to all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.59,0:17:06.01,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Here's my gift to all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.43,0:17:13.06,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,So this scene still exists, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.06,0:17:14.56,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Children.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.52,0:17:18.56,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,This is the best gift I can give you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.15,0:17:22.57,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,A gift without form called memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.94,0:17:24.61,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,I don't have money.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.94,0:17:27.57,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,I can't buy you anything with form.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.32,0:17:29.28,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Even so-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.12,0:17:31.37,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.70,0:17:34.66,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,He really hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.66,0:17:36.50,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.46,0:17:39.54,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,They've finally turned the tables around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.54,0:17:40.79,Default,San,0,0,0,,Fight, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.00,0:17:42.17,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.17,0:17:44.55,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,It's not your fault, Nagisa-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.55,0:17:46.09,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,They're just too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.26,0:17:49.47,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,It was off your wild throw that the last run advanced.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.47,0:17:52.10,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Before that, you made the wrong play.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.10,0:17:57.56,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,It was also you who missed the pop fly and let the runner who scored the fifth run reach base.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.19,0:18:02.57,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I locked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.57,0:18:03.82,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,One down...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.82,0:18:04.94,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Nagisa, go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.40,0:18:06.15,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.44,0:18:08.36,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Calm down, Nagisa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.36,0:18:10.11,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Concentrate, Nagisa-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.11,0:18:12.16,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Swing as hard as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.41,0:18:14.24,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Relax, relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.24,0:18:15.79,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't worry about getting out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.79,0:18:18.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Swing hard so you won't regret anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.62,0:18:20.54,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,So I won't regret...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.84,0:18:27.67,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.67,0:18:30.13,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Good! Now that's my daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.13,0:18:32.30,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,I'll hit it as hard as I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.22,0:18:38.02,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Can't do anything about that one. It was unlucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.73,0:18:40.94,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Am I smiling right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.94,0:18:43.02,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.52,0:18:45.44,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Sorry for being like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.44,0:18:47.24,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Sorry for being so pathetic...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.24,0:18:48.57,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Sorry for being this kind of memory...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.95,0:18:49.57,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,But!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.82,0:18:51.57,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,I will smile in the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.07,0:18:53.83,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Good luck, Yu-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.99,0:18:59.33,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Here's my gift to you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.58,0:19:05.34,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,All right, we have two runners on base.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.34,0:19:06.67,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Children.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.51,0:19:09.05,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,This is the best gift!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.05,0:19:10.13,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Time out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.30,0:19:14.43,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,This is the best gift I can give you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.26,0:19:18.18,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,A gift without form called memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.93,0:19:20.48,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,I don't have money.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.48,0:19:23.19,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,I can't buy you anything with form.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.48,0:19:28.40,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Even so, even without form, a memory will last forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.28,0:19:32.36,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,I believe that it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.78,0:19:35.07,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Um... Are you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.07,0:19:36.58,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.99,0:19:40.41,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Good job, Yu-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.41,0:19:43.54,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I'm touched by your words, Yoshino-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.93,0:19:54.84,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Hey brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.47,0:19:58.06,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,It's two outs, bases loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.06,0:19:59.35,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You can't go for a squeeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.39,0:20:02.56,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Everything's up to you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.85,0:20:04.77,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But my shoulder is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.40,0:20:06.98,Default,San,0,0,0,,Okazaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.94,0:20:10.11,Default,San,0,0,0,,Fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.69,0:20:13.11,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,You'd better let Nagisa step on home plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.32,0:20:15.82,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Please give it your best, Okazaki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.20,0:20:18.16,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,You can hit it, Okazaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.74,0:20:20.70,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Good luck, Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.25,0:20:23.96,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Bring the win back to this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.69,0:20:51.69,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Misae-san. May I come visit your home again?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.69,0:20:54.07,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Sure. Come any time you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.28,0:20:56.41,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.41,0:20:58.07,Default,San,0,0,0,,Eat all you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.41,0:21:01.20,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,It looks very, very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.20,0:21:02.25,Default,Bot,0,0,0,,Puhi puhi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.62,0:21:07.12,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I've been wondering all this time, but who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.12,0:21:08.58,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Nagisa-chan's sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.58,0:21:10.34,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.34,0:21:12.71,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Babe sisters, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.55,0:21:16.38,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Nagisa-san. I have a favor to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.38,0:21:17.47,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.05,0:21:18.80,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.10,0:21:21.47,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,That seriously felt good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.47,0:21:23.93,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,This has got to be the strongest possible team.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.27,0:21:26.19,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,You looked really good out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.39,0:21:28.69,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Let's play another game with these members!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.15,0:21:32.32,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,If it's for the cause of making memories, call me anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.90,0:21:34.82,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Let's get this started.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.82,0:21:38.61,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,To celebrate the Furukawa Bakers' victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.95,0:21:40.78,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.75,0:21:48.17,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.83,0:21:49.88,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.89,0:22:09.85,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(1459.999969,840)\bord0.75\3c&H000000&\blur0.5}To be continued
