Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.00,0:23:19.55,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There'll be a small silhouette leading to tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.00,0:23:19.55,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf46}a{\kf52}su {\kf72}he {\kf24}to {\kf46}tsu{\kf25}zu{\kf108}ku {\kf44}chi{\kf33}i{\kf26}sa{\kf61}na {\kf78}shi{\kf71}ru{\kf73}be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.55,0:23:27.10,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The word you said that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.55,0:23:27.10,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf44}i{\kf52}ma {\kf70}mo {\kf67}ma{\kf144}da {\kf45}ko{\kf46}da{\kf63}ma {\kf80}su{\kf140}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.10,0:23:34.61,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}...still echoes in my head, and let's make it an oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.10,0:23:34.61,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf48}a{\kf46}no {\kf70}hi {\kf27}no {\kf44}ko{\kf26}to{\kf104}ba {\kf51}chi{\kf30}ka{\kf27}i {\kf93}ni {\kf71}ka{\kf113}e
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.61,0:23:39.86,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I will continue going with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.61,0:23:39.86,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf42}bo{\kf34}ku {\kf18}wa {\kf166}yu{\kf266}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.86,0:23:43.82,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs99.999996\fad(0,400)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,470.000015)\blur0.5\bord0.75\3c&H000000&}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.86,0:23:46.87,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Sunohara-san. Do you have a goal or something you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.74,0:23:49.54,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I've never thought about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.50,0:23:55.04,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I can't go to college, so I'll find a job and work.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.63,0:24:03.34,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Well, if I had a level-headed girlfriend, too,\NI bet my sister would rest easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.30,0:24:05.72,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.72,0:24:09.72,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Good luck, Sunohara-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.76,0:24:09.72,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,405)\bord0.75\blur0.5\3c&H00000A&}Episode 2
